# Deployment — tv.bakeandgrill.mv

## RULE: After EVERY `git push`, ALWAYS print this exact block — no exceptions

```
─────────────────────────────────────────
 cPanel Pull & Deploy
─────────────────────────────────────────
 1. SSH into cPanel, then run:

 bash ~/tv.bakeandgrill.mv/scripts/server-pull-deploy.sh

 (If pull fails with "untracked working tree files would be overwritten", run that script —
  it removes old manual docroot copies then pulls.)

 2. cPanel → Setup Node.js App → RESTART

 3. Verify frontend actually updated (must show 1.3.x, NOT 1.2.7):
 curl -s https://tv.bakeandgrill.mv/version.json
 curl -s https://tv.bakeandgrill.mv/api/health

 4. Hard-refresh browser or use private window. Footer must match version.json.
─────────────────────────────────────────
```

**Important:** `index.html` and `assets/` live at the **git repo root** (docroot). `git pull` alone deploys the frontend — no `cp` step needed if root files are committed.

If `version.json` is missing or stale after pull, run on server:
`bash scripts/publish-frontend.sh` (only works if `client/dist` exists from pull).

