## If you need to run npm install on the server

```bash
source ~/nodevenv/tv.bakeandgrill.mv/server/18/bin/activate
npm install --prefix ~/tv.bakeandgrill.mv/server --omit=dev
```

---

## NEVER do these on the cPanel server
- `npm run build` — vite is not installed on the server
- `cd /home/bakegril/tv.bakeandgrill.mv` — wrong path, use `~/tv.bakeandgrill.mv`
- `git pull origin main` alone (without `GIT_SSH_COMMAND`) — will fail with "Repository not found"
- `source ~/nodevenv/tv.bakeandgrill.mv/server/20/bin/activate` — Node 20 is not installed, use 18
- Assuming deploy worked without checking `curl …/version.json` — old `index-HwyNGss9.js` means frontend was never updated

